{"id":"b34432f4c02d5e16","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-fo-number-ordered.md","title":"有序数值输入上的 NUMBER 不增加一阶表达力","display":"thm-fo-number-ordered — 有序数值输入上的 NUMBER 不增加一阶表达力","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-fo-number-ordered","aliases":["29-thm-fo-number-ordered"],"display":"thm-fo-number-ordered — 有序数值输入上的 NUMBER 不增加一阶表达力","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-number]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"Proposition 12.16, p.187, DjVu scan 202; Definition 12.11, p.186, scan 201; Proviso 1.14, p.13, scan 28","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述比对及排序翻译的本地论证","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-fo-number-ordered"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-fo-number-ordered</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fo-number-ordered — 有序数值输入上的 NUMBER 不增加一阶表达力"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" href=\"?note=edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" title=\"29-df-fo-number\">29-df-fo-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Proposition 12.16, p.187, DjVu scan 202; Definition 12.11, p.186, scan 201; Proviso 1.14, p.13, scan 28"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述比对及排序翻译的本地论证"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\notin\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)}\\}\">\\(\\sigma=\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)}\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a> 的标准 BIT 扩张，对象排序已同时带序与标准 BIT。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(U^{\\mathrm{BIT}})^\\#\">\\((U^{\\mathrm{BIT}})^\\#\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}}\">\\(N_{U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" href=\"?note=edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" title=\"29-df-fo-number\">29-df-fo-number</a> 的双排序语义；其双排序赋值集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_U\">\\(\\mathcal A_U\\)</span> 在下面构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 表示没有自由变量的 NUMBER 公式；NUMBER 的句子语法直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" href=\"?note=edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" title=\"29-df-fo-number\">29-df-fo-number</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_U\\coloneqq|A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}}\\times N_{U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}}^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}},\\qquad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_U\\coloneqq|A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}}\\times N_{U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}}^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}},\\qquad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left\\{\\left\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathcal A_U\\;((U^{\\mathrm{BIT}})^\\#,\\beta\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\phi)\\right\\}\\ \\middle|\\ \\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\sigma]\\right\\}=Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left\\{\\left\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathcal A_U\\;((U^{\\mathrm{BIT}})^\\#,\\beta\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\phi)\\right\\}\\ \\middle|\\ \\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\sigma]\\right\\}=Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 12.16，印刷187页、扫描202，第一条等式为 FO(NUMBER)=FO；原书 FO 默认含数值关系，见 Proviso 1.14，印刷13页、扫描28。本条将该条件显式展开：不能只给对象域添加序，却试图用独立数值域的 BIT 自动定义对象域的 BIT。</p>\n<p>翻译依据：给定对象域的递增双射 e_U，将每个数值变量重命名为新的对象变量；数值比较和 BIT 依次换为对象排序的标准数值关系，常元0、max取序端点，1取第二元素（单元素时取唯一元素）。一阶逻辑可用唯一端点及第二元素的定义消去这些新常元。两排序变量先重命名为互不交的名称，保持每一量词的论域及参数次序。归纳于公式树可验证真值保持；反向将原对象 FO 公式直接视为 NUMBER 的对象排序子语言。单元素域两排序都只有一个元素，局部1=0约定与翻译一致。这里给出排序翻译的数学论证，未声称执行了原书 Exercise 12.17 的机器证明；库中 BIT 与原书交换两个参数的记号约定仍保持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-number","status":"resolved","id":"edcb3c1ba71c78c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$；$U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]$ 是 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]] 的标准 BIT 扩张，对象排序已同时带序与标准 BIT。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-number","status":"resolved","id":"edcb3c1ba71c78c8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(U^{\\mathrm{BIT}})^\\#$、$N_{U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}}$、$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}$ 与 $\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}$ 取 [[29-df-fo-number]] 的双排序语义；其双排序赋值集合 $\\mathcal A_U$ 在下面构造。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-number","status":"resolved","id":"edcb3c1ba71c78c8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\sigma]$ 表示没有自由变量的 NUMBER 公式；NUMBER 的句子语法直接取 [[29-df-fo-number]]。$Q(\\mathrm{FO}[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\sigma]$ 表示没有自由变量的 NUMBER 公式；NUMBER 的句子语法直接取 [[29-df-fo-number]]。$Q(\\mathrm{FO}[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<,\\mathrm{BIT}\\notin\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=\\tau\\cup\\{<^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"(U^{\\mathrm{BIT}})^\\#","display":false},{"tex":"N_{U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\mathrm{FO}[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_U\\coloneqq|A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}}\\times N_{U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}}^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}},\\qquad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"\\left\\{\\left\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathcal A_U\\;((U^{\\mathrm{BIT}})^\\#,\\beta\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\phi)\\right\\}\\ \\middle|\\ \\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\sigma]\\right\\}=Q(\\mathrm{FO}[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau].","display":true}],"bytes":3205,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-fo-number-ordered]] — 对象排序含标准 BIT 时 NUMBER 不增加 FO 表达力"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-fo-number-ordered]]"},{"id":"ef134b4589bf7f20","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-